"Optimize for Retina displays" = "针对 Retina 显示器优化";
"Asks the desktop for twice the pixels at 200% scaling, so text is sharp on a Retina display. Uses more bandwidth. Works with Fit to window." = "向远程桌面请求两倍像素并以 200% 缩放，在 Retina 屏幕上文字会很清晰。会占用更多带宽，仅在“跟随窗口”时有效。";
"Connection quality" = "连接质量";
"Best quality (LAN)" = "最佳画质（局域网）";
"Balanced (broadband)" = "平衡（宽带）";
"Fastest (slow network)" = "最快（慢速网络）";
"Best quality shows the wallpaper, smooth fonts, and visual effects. Balanced hides the wallpaper. Fastest also turns off themes, animations, and font smoothing for a slow network." = "最佳画质会显示桌面背景、平滑字体和视觉效果。平衡会隐藏桌面背景。最快还会关闭主题、动画和字体平滑，适合慢速网络。";
"Clipboard" = "剪贴板";
"Check for Updates" = "检查更新";
"Check for updates automatically" = "自动检查更新";
"Once a day, Gloamux asks GitHub whether a newer version is out, sending only the app's name and version. Check at any time from Gloamux › Check for Updates." = "Gloamux 每天会向 GitHub 查询一次是否有新版本，只会发送 App 的名称和版本。随时可以从 Gloamux › 检查更新 立即检查。";
"SSH jump hosts" = "SSH 跳板机";
"Gloamux connects to these in order, from the top, and reaches this server from the last one. A password typed here is used for this connection only; after it works, it is remembered like any other." = "Gloamux 会从上到下依次连接这些跳板机，再从最后一台连接到这台服务器。在这里输入的密码只用于这次连接；登录成功后，会和其他密码一样被记住。";
"Remove this jump host" = "移除这个跳板机";
"Jump host %d" = "跳板机 %d";
"Add jump host" = "添加跳板机";
"Save another SSH session first to use it as a jump host." = "请先保存另一个 SSH 连接，才能把它用作跳板机。";
"Connect through another saved SSH session" = "通过另一个已保存的 SSH 连接进行连接";
"Gloamux connects to the jump hosts in order, from the first, and reaches this server from the last one. Only the first one uses its own jump host settings." = "Gloamux 会从第一台开始依次连接跳板机，再从最后一台连接到这台服务器。只有第一台会使用它自己的跳板机设置。";
"Some jump hosts could not be found in this file. Set the jump hosts in Gloamux." = "此文件中找不到部分跳板机。请在 Gloamux 中设置跳板机。";
"Connection route" = "连接路径";
"Gloamux signs in to each jump host in turn and asks it to open the connection to the next host, so each host is reached only from the one above it. Check from each server asks every server where the connection came from (echo $SSH_CONNECTION); each one should name the host above it. A server set to run a fixed command for your key runs that command instead." = "Gloamux 会依次登录每一台跳板机，并请它打开到下一台主机的连接，所以每台主机只会从它上面那一台连进来。“从每台服务器确认”会询问每台服务器连接来自哪里（echo $SSH_CONNECTION），每一台都应该显示它上面那一台。如果服务器为你的密钥设置了固定命令，则会改为运行该命令。";
"Check from each server" = "从每台服务器确认";
"Came from %@" = "来自 %@";
"The host above" = "正是上一台";
"This server did not say where the connection came from." = "这台服务器没有报告连接来源。";

"New session from sftp command" = "从 sftp 命令新建会话";
"Paste the sftp command once. Gloamux saves the host, port, sign-in, and folders as a session. Later, open that session and enter only the new session key." = "粘贴一次 sftp 命令，Gloamux 会把主机、端口、登录方式和文件夹保存为会话。之后打开它，只需输入新的会话密钥。";
"sftp command" = "sftp 命令";
"Save and connect" = "保存并连接";
"%@ is a session key" = "%@ 是会话密钥";
"Gloamux asks for the session key each time instead of saving it. Turn this off when it is an ordinary user name." = "Gloamux 不会保存会话密钥，每次连接时才询问。如果这是普通用户名，请关闭。";
"Download to" = "下载到";
"Copy these files after connecting" = "连接后传输这些文件";
"%d more" = "还有 %d 个";
"Replace existing files" = "替换现有文件";
"Not included" = "未包含";
"Session key" = "会话密钥";
"Paste the key, or the whole sftp command it came in. Gloamux keeps it until you quit and never saves it." = "粘贴密钥，或整段 sftp 命令都可以。Gloamux 只保留到退出为止，不会保存。";
"Paste from the clipboard" = "从剪贴板粘贴";
"Waiting for the session key" = "等待输入会话密钥";
"Sign-in" = "登录方式";
"Password or key" = "密码或密钥";
"Answer the server each time" = "每次回答服务器的问题";
"Session key each time" = "每次输入会话密钥";
"Choose a session key when an access gateway gives you a new key in place of the user name. Gloamux asks for it when you connect, keeps it until you quit, and never saves it." = "如果访问网关每次给你一组新密钥代替用户名，请选择会话密钥。Gloamux 连接时才询问，只保留到退出为止，不会保存。";
"Remote folder" = "远程文件夹";
"Folder on this Mac" = "这台 Mac 的文件夹";
"Session Log" = "连接记录";
"Each connection is saved as one record: when, where, how it ended, and which files were copied. Passwords, session keys, answers, and terminal output are not part of it. Records are kept for a year, up to 2,000." = "每次连接保存为一条：时间、位置、结果，以及传输了哪些文件。不包含密码、会话密钥、回答和终端内容。保留一年，最多 2,000 条。";
"Export as CSV" = "导出 CSV";
"Export as JSON" = "导出 JSON";
"Keep connection history" = "保留连接记录";
"History options" = "记录选项";
"No connections yet" = "还没有连接记录";
"Download log" = "下载记录";
"Choose a connection" = "选择一条连接";
"Clear the connection history?" = "要清除连接记录吗？";
"Terminal logs stay in their folder. This cannot be undone." = "终端日志会留在原文件夹。此操作无法撤销。";
"The history could not be changed." = "无法更改连接记录。";
"Connecting" = "连接中";
"Ended unexpectedly" = "未正常结束";
"Connection started" = "开始连接";
"Signed in" = "已登录";
"Downloaded" = "已下载";
"Uploaded" = "已上传";
"Transfer failed" = "传输失败";
"Skipped" = "已跳过";
"The server refused this session key or user name. Check it and try again." = "服务器拒绝了这个会话密钥或用户名。请检查后重试。";
"Enter the session key." = "请输入会话密钥。";
"The sftp command is too long." = "sftp 命令太长。";
"Paste a command that starts with sftp." = "请粘贴以 sftp 开头的命令。";
"The sftp command has no host." = "sftp 命令里没有主机。";
"The sftp command has an invalid user name." = "sftp 命令里的用户名无效。";
"A quote is not closed." = "引号没有成对。";
"Choose" = "选择";
